WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:02.467
I see Xuan Kingdom's flag

00:02.920 --> 00:04.587
I see Xuan Kingdom's flag

00:05.640 --> 00:07.280
I see Xuan Kingdom's military flag

00:07.360 --> 00:09.000
The royal army is going north

00:09.080 --> 00:10.840
I see Xuan Kingdom's military flag

00:10.920 --> 00:11.440
The royal army is going north

00:11.520 --> 00:12.720
Stop wailing

00:12.800 --> 00:14.200
Can you even read?

00:14.360 --> 00:15.240
I only know

00:15.320 --> 00:17.680
My father drew it for me before he died

00:17.760 --> 00:19.560
That really is Xuan Kingdom's military flag

00:19.640 --> 00:21.307
I see so many soldiers

00:22.320 --> 00:24.280
If you don't believe me, come and see

00:24.360 --> 00:24.800
Really

00:24.960 --> 00:25.720
Come on, come on

00:25.800 --> 00:27.200
Hurry up

00:33.400 --> 00:34.000
Your Highness

00:34.080 --> 00:35.080
That little thief we chased earlier

00:35.200 --> 00:37.533
Has brought a group of people over

00:48.400 --> 00:50.733
It really is Xuan Kingdom's military flag

00:53.360 --> 00:54.760
It's true

00:56.480 --> 00:59.080
We respectfully welcome the royal army going north

01:05.360 --> 01:06.120
Sheathe your swords

01:06.200 --> 01:07.600
Dismount

01:10.040 --> 01:11.440
All rise

01:16.400 --> 01:18.000
Hearing the royal army is going north

01:18.080 --> 01:19.440
Passing through our village

01:19.520 --> 01:20.240
We

01:20.320 --> 01:21.720
Gathered some grain

01:22.920 --> 01:24.520
Everyone, share it

01:33.680 --> 01:35.080
Sir

01:35.680 --> 01:36.840
The village

01:36.920 --> 01:39.253
Has been stripped bare by the Wutu

01:39.680 --> 01:40.680
This

01:40.760 --> 01:42.120
Please don't look down on it

